                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ24ETXymtQjQRznH-ZnUhaK8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sMlIxcHFZWGRqUVdoNk1XUllVWFJETFUxa2IxRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The menu offers a wide variety of dishes with plenty of choices.\n\nA beverage machine is available for self-service.\n\nI ordered the fried pork cutlet set meal for $165 + mentaiko zucchini for $80.\n\n🔸Fried Pork Cutlet: The pork cutlet was thick and substantial, with a firm texture.\n\nHowever, the batter was just average; I didn\u0027t particularly like it.\n\nThe side dishes included shredded cabbage, bean sprouts, and pickled radish, a refreshing combination.\n\nThe bean sprouts were well-seasoned, flavorful, and slightly salty.\n\n🔸Mentaiko Zucchini: Savory with a hint of spiciness, the zucchini was tender yet still crisp, and the addition of fish roe added a delightful texture.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "餐點種類豐富，選擇性高。\n有飲料機，可自行取用。\n\n點了炸豬排定食 $165 + 明太子節瓜 $80。\n🔸炸豬排\n肉厚實有份量，口感紮實。\n不過麵衣表現普通，個人沒有特別喜歡。\n配菜有高麗菜絲、豆芽菜和醃漬蘿蔔，搭配算清爽。\n豆芽菜調味不錯，味道夠、帶點鹹香。\n\n🔸明太子節瓜\n鮮鹹中帶微辣，節瓜口感軟嫩又保有爽脆度，搭配魚卵顆粒感，層次豐富。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
